uto\"},[5,\"Predefined alphanumerical text\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"‘This e-money token (“USDG”) is not covered by the investor compensation schemes under Directive 97/9/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council or the deposit guarantee schemes under Directive 2014/49/EU of the European Parliament and of the Council.’\"]]]],[4,\"tr\",null,[4,\"td\",{\"colSpan\":\"5\"},[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"strong\",null,[5,\"SUMMARY\"]]]]],[4,\"tr\",null,[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"I.05\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Warning in accordance with Article 51(6), second subparagraph of Regulation (EU) 2023/1114\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"This summary should be read as an introduction to the crypto-asset white paper.\"],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"The prospective holder should base any decision to purchase this e-money token on the content of the crypto-asset white paper as a whole and not on the summary alone.\"],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"The offer to the public of this crypto-asset does not constitute an offer or solicitation to purchase financial instruments and that any such offer or solicitation can be made only by means of a prospectus or other offer documents pursuant to the applicable national law.\"],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"This crypto-asset white paper does not constitute a prospectus as referred to in Regulation (EU) 2017/1129 of the European Parliament and of the Council or any other offer document pursuant to Union or national law.’\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Predefined alphanumerical text\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"This summary should be read as an introduction to the crypto-asset white paper.\"],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"The prospective holder should base any decision to purchase this e-money token on the content of the crypto-asset white paper as a whole and not on the summary alone.\"],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"The offer to the public of this crypto-asset does not constitute an offer or solicitation to purchase financial instruments and that any such offer or solicitation can be made only by means of a prospectus or other offer documents pursuant to the applicable national law.\"],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"This crypto-asset white paper does not constitute a prospectus as referred to in Regulation (EU) 2017/1129 of the European Parliament and of the Council or any other offer document pursuant to Union or national law.’\"]]]],[4,\"tr\",null,[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"I.06\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Characteristics of the crypto-asset\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"A brief, clear and non-technical description of the characteristics of the crypto-assets concerned in order to help prospective holders of the crypto-asset make an informed decision\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Free alphanumerical text\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The Global Dollar or USDG is an Electronic Money Token (EMT) representing 1 US Dollar on the blockchain, designed to maintain a stable 1:1 value peg and backed by equivalent reserve assets held in segregated, bankruptcy-remote accounts.\"],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"USDG is a stablecoin fully backed by the United States Dollar (USD) that is issued by Paxos EU, supervised by the Finnish Financial Supervisory Authority. For every USDG in circulation in the European Economic Area (“EEA”), Paxos EU will keep equivalent reserve assets in segregated, bankruptcy-remote accounts on behalf of token holders. These reserves are duly managed under an extensive regulatory framework, which ensures that  holders of USDG tokens can redeem their USDG for USD at a 1:1 ratio at any time without incurring fees.\"]]]],[4,\"tr\",null,[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"I.07\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Right of redemption\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"‘The holders of this e-money token have a right of redemption at any time and at par value.’\"],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"Description of the conditions for such redemption.\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Predefined alphanumerical text\"],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"Free alphanumerical text\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"USDG is fully redeemable from Paxos on a one-to-one basis for US dollars (1 USDG = 1 USD). The holders of USDG residents of the EEA have a right of redemption with Paxos EU at any time and at par value. USDG holders not residing in the EEA can redeem their USDG with Paxos Digital Singapore Pte. Ltd. (“PDS”), as described in the \"],[2,{\"href\":{\"webPageId\":\"D24h7Ig6J\",\"pathVariables\":{\"GicWRpwHo\":\"stablecoin-terms-conditions\"},\"unresolvedPathSlugs\":{\"GicWRpwHo\":{\"collectionItemId\":\"elRD0tblR\",\"collectionId\":\"WCTPo9O9O\"}}},\"openInNewTab\":false,\"smoothScroll\":false,\"relValues\":[],\"motionChild\":true,\"nodeId\":\"WCTPo9O9O\",\"scopeId\":\"contentManagement\"},[4,\"a\",null,[5,\"Paxos US Dollar-Backed Stablecoin Terms and Conditions\"]]],[5,\". \"],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"All redemption requests are subject to compliance reviews, which are used to confirm regulatory adherence, ensuring that the redemption process is secure and compliant with all relevant legislation and other regulatory obligations Paxos EU is subject to.\"],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"Upon redemption, USDG tokens are removed from the supply and burned. All redemptions are on a one-for-one basis, notwithstanding any change in the market value of stablecoins or reserve assets. \"],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"See more details on USDG Holders’ Right of redemption in section D of this whitepaper.\"]]]],[4,\"tr\",null,[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"I.08\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Key information about the offer and/ or admission to trading\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Key information about the offer to the public of the e-money token or the intended admission to trading of such e-money token.\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Free alphanumerical text\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The minting of USDG is available exclusively on the Paxos Platform for institutions that have successfully completed the requisite onboarding procedures within supported jurisdictions. European Union-based institutions seeking to mint USDG must complete the onboarding process with Paxos EU (Paxos EU), which includes the provision of all necessary Know Your Customer (KYC) documentation.\"],[4,\"br\",null],[5,\"Furthermore, USDG will also be accessible for trading and transferring through crypto-asset service providers regulated within the European Union. Prospective holders of USDG are strongly encouraged by Paxos EU to visit the designated availability page  to verify whether an entity offering USDG has been formally recognized by Paxos EU as a USDG distributor.\"]]]],[4,\"tr\",null,[4,\"td\",{\"colSpan\":\"4\"},[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"em\",null,[5,\"Part A- Information about the issuer of the e-money token\"]]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[4,\"br\",{\"className\":\"trailing-break\"}]]]],[4,\"tr\",null,[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"A.1\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Statutory name\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Statutory Name\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Free alphanumerical text\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Paxos Issuance Europe Oy\"]]]],[4,\"tr\",null,[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"A.2\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Trading name\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Trading Name\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Free alphanumerical text\"]]],[4,\"td\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Paxos EU\"]]]],[